# Firebase service-account private key — provided at runtime via FIREBASE_KEY_JSON
# (see _ensure_firebase). NEVER bake it into an image layer: `COPY . /app` in the
# Dockerfile would otherwise embed the live private key in every built image.
firebase_key.json
*firebase*.json
